=\\\"Loading\\\" src=\\\"https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/G/01/x-locale/common/grey-pixel.gif\\\" class=\\\"a-lazy-loaded\\\" data-src=\\\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/G/01/blue_loader/BH-loader.gif\\\" style=\\\"\\\"><noscript><img alt=\\\"Loading\\\" src=\\\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/G/01/blue_loader/BH-loader.gif\\\"></noscript></div><div id=\\\"ask-answer-container\\\"></div> </div></div> </div> <div id=\\\"productDescription_feature_div\\\" class=\\\"celwidget pd_rd_w-66Ogx pd_rd_r-EHHC2S1EY6KBRYVMCKB4 pd_rd_wg-DUuoW\\\" data-feature-name=\\\"productDescription-3\\\" data-csa-c-type=\\\"widget\\\" data-csa-c-content-id=\\\"productDescription-3\\\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\\\"productDescription_feature_div\\\" data-csa-c-asin=\\\"\\\" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row=\\\"false\\\" data-cel-widget=\\\"productDescription_feature_div\\\"> <div> <div data-feature-name=\\\"productDescription\\\" data-template-name=\\\"productDescription\\\" id=\\\"productDescription_feature_div\\\" class=\\\"a-row feature\\\" data-cel-widget=\\\"productDescription_feature_div\\\"> <div class=\\\"a-divider a-divider-section\\\"><div class=\\\"a-divider-inner\\\"></div></div> <h2 class=\\\"default\\\"> Product description </h2> <div id=\\\"productDescription\\\" class=\\\"a-section a-spacing-small\\\"> <p> <span>Introducing the HL316IX Tall Larder Fridge, the perfect addition to any modern kitchen. This stylish and functional freestanding larder fridge boasts a generous 242L capacity, providing ample storage space for all your groceries. Whether you're a large family or enjoy hosting dinner parties, this larder fridge provides plenty of room for fresh produce, beverages, and favorite foods. Standing at an impressive 140cm tall, the HL316IX larder fridge is designed to maximize your kitchen space while offering convenient access to your stored items. Its sleek and contemporary design complements any kitchen decor, making it a versatile kitchen appliance that enhances functionality and aesthetics. The reversible door feature adds flexibility, allowing you to adjust the fridge's layout to best suit your kitchen's configuration. Inside, the HL316IX larder fridge has four movable glass shelves, providing customizable storage solutions to accommodate items of various sizes. The crisper drawer is perfect for keeping fruits, herbs, and vegetables fresh, while the multiple-door balconies offer convenient storage for bottles, condiments, and other frequently used items. The bright LED light illuminates the interior, ensuring clear visibility of all contents, even in low-light conditions. This tall larder fridge operates with a mechanical temperature control, allowing you to set the optimal temperature for your food storage needs. The fridge maintains a consistent climate, thanks to its N/ST climate class rating, ensuring reliable performance in ambient temperatures. The HL316IX larder fridge operates quietly with a noise level of just 40dB, making it an unobtrusive addition to your home. Safety is paramount with the HL316IX larder fridge. It features RoHS compatibility and includes important safety guidelines for handling flammable materials in refrigerant pipes and the compressor. This attention to safety ensures that your kitchen appliance operates efficiently and securely. With its 242L capacity, the HL316IX larder fridge provides a practical solution for all your food storage needs. Whether you're looking for a larder fridge tall enough to stand out in your kitchen or a freestanding larder fridge that offers versatility and style, this appliance is an excellent choice. Enhance your kitchen with the HL316IX larder fridge and experience the perfect design, functionality, and convenience blend. Upgrade your kitchen with the HL316IX Tall Larder Fridge today and enjoy the benefits of a spacious, stylish, and efficient kitchen appliance that caters to all your refrigeration needs.</span> </p> </div> <template data-capture-omitted=\\\